<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00703">
	<title>Highway Driving Assist settings</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>highway driving assist (HDA) 
					<indexterm>settings</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<table frame="none" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc_none">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc">
				<colspec colnum="1" colname="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colnum="2" colname="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="1" colsep="0">
							<fig>
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/N_CT25Z023_E.eps" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="2">
							<ol outputclass="callout">
								<li>
									<p> <uicontrol>Driver assistance</uicontrol> </p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p> <uicontrol>Driving Convenience</uicontrol> </p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p> <uicontrol>HDA (Motorway Driving Assist)</uicontrol> </p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p> <uicontrol>Lane change assist (motorway)</uicontrol> </p>
								</li>
							</ol>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>With the vehicle is in <term translate="no">DRIVE READY</term>, touch or select <menucascade><uicontrol>Settings</uicontrol><uicontrol>Vehicle</uicontrol><uicontrol>Driver assistance</uicontrol><uicontrol>Driving Convenience</uicontrol></menucascade> on the infotainment system to set whether to use each function.</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p>If <uicontrol>HDA (highway Driving Assist)</uicontrol> is selected, it helps maintain distance from the vehicle ahead, maintain the set speed, and helps center the vehicle in the lane.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</conbody>
</concept>